          Healthcare and institutional facilities require documented energy performance — Solar Gard Panorama and Sentinel Plus both carry NFRC-certified VLT, SHGC, and U-value ratings
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Schools, government facilities, and high-occupancy buildings need both solar control and safety film — ArmorCoat provides fragment retention and GSA-tested blast performance
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
