      <p style="font-family:var(--font-body,'DM Sans',sans-serif);font-size:15px;color:var(--text-mid,#4a4a4a);line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;">Zone 4A puts Philadelphia glass under pressure year-round — summer solar gain in Center City towers, winter heat loss in South Philly rowhomes, and security requirements that vary from Old City retail to University City institutional campuses. Solar Gard's Panorama, Sentinel Plus, ArmorCoat, and Ecolux lines address each of those needs with documented, warranted performance.</p>
