      <p class="sg-pl-row__body">Solar Gard Panorama is the flagship commercial solar control film — non-metallized spectrally selective, rejects up to 77% solar energy, 99% UV, VLT 25–70%. No Wi-Fi interference. Near-neutral exterior under 10% reflectance.</p>
      <p class="sg-pl-row__body">For Philadelphia's south- and west-facing commercial glazing, Panorama consistently delivers the highest solar heat rejection in its class. NFRC-certified for VLT, SHGC, and U-value. See how Panorama fits a broader <a href="/benefits/energy-savings/" class="sg-body-link">energy savings</a> strategy for Philadelphia buildings.</p>
