      <h3 class="sg-pl-row__heading">Sentinel Plus — Energy Savings for Philadelphia's Institutional Buildings</h3>
      <p class="sg-pl-row__body">Solar Gard Sentinel Plus is engineered for healthcare, educational, and large commercial facilities — buildings that need both summer solar control and year-round energy performance documentation. Compatible with LEED Energy and Atmosphere credit documentation.</p>
      <p class="sg-pl-row__body">Provides NFRC-certified VLT, SHGC, and U-value data compatible with most sustainability reporting frameworks. Window Film Philadelphia provides complete data sheets and installation records for every Sentinel Plus project. For Philadelphia office specifications across multiple floors, our <a href="/applications/office/" class="sg-body-link">commercial office window film</a> page covers how we approach large-scale installs.</p>
