      <p class="sg-pl-row__body">Solar Gard ArmorCoat is a heavy-duty safety and security film series — 4 to 14 mil — engineered to hold glass fragments in place after impact, delay forced entry, and provide blast mitigation performance tested to ASTM F1642. At 14 mil, delivers maximum fragment retention for government facilities, courthouses, and high-security commercial properties.</p>
      <p class="sg-pl-row__body">In Philadelphia, ArmorCoat is most commonly installed at Old City and Center City retail, K-12 school entrance glass, and government facilities. ArmorCoat holds glass together — it does not make glass unbreakable. Our <a href="/benefits/safety-and-security/" class="sg-body-link">safety and security window film</a> page covers the full range of options across brands.</p>
